<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $58-1/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $58-1/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened $0-1/8 higher at $58-1/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>The price corresponds to about 265.24 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
